How it's now:
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45246694/ca228e4b8bbf523d8f9ea44674b5607cd19e2ed2.jpg

v1.1.21 patch notes:

Fixed the localization for records;
Fixed the localization for Quality dropdown menu;
Fixed the localization for Transmission dropdown menu;
Replaced 'český' to 'Čeština';
Fixed text that was outside the intended bounds.

Patch notes and fixes:

Added deadzones for input of gamepads when controlling a car;
Fixed deadzones for camera;
Fixed occlusion culling for 'trash' on the map;
Fixed trees' collisions which didn't have them again;
Fixed occlusion culling for the grass.

Patch notes:

 Fixed trees' wrong positions;
 Added music slider to menu's settings.
